  (text "Placing Q310/Q302 inside the feedback loop improves things, but compensation of U301\nmay be inadequate.\n\n(Try to provoke it if necessary by pulling decoupling capacitors, adding a\ncapacitive load, ...)\n\nThen tame the oscillation with R301/C301.\n\nObserve that the signal still glitches near the crossover points.\nFundamental reason: finite slew rate.\n\nDecrease signal amplitude to 1 V_{pp} and show a mess."
    (at 124.46 53.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0c9efecc-9c8a-42b4-a663-d2ac44163559)
  )

